@startuml Heritage_Site SequenceDiagram
actor Visitor
participant "Mobile App" as App
participant "Backend API" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

Visitor -> App: Request heritage site information

App -> API: GET /api/heritage-sites/{siteId}

API -> DB: Retrieve HeritageSite by siteId
DB --> API: HeritageSite data

API --> App: Heritage site response

App --> Visitor: Display heritage site information
@enduml